,"total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738334538","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114877#issuecomment-3738334538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877","id":3738334538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e0nVK","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T12:31:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T12:33:36Z","body":"That doesn't seem reliable, that that might be an error specifically in the editor highlighting, not the actual inferred type, you should for example test to assign to the variable with a different type that's assumed to be incompatible based on the variable","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738334538/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738557512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114877#issuecomment-3738557512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877","id":3738557512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e1dxI","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T13:28:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:28:44Z","body":"> that that might be an error specifically in the editor highlighting, not the actual inferred type\n\nWhy is the tooltip should be different from the \"actual inferred type\" at runtime? That's just adds to the confusion and makes the type system unreliable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738557512/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738564545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114877#issuecomment-3738564545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877","id":3738564545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e1ffB","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T13:30:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:30:20Z","body":"Because it is a guess by the system, it can't know if the data is dynamic, but I never said it *should* be different, where did you get that?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738564545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738567747","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114877#issuecomment-3738567747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877","id":3738567747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e1gRD","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T13:31:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:34:13Z","body":"Please note that this error only occurs for types-as-values. In the following case, GDScript correctly reports the incompatibility between the ternary operator branches and inference on variant:\n\n```gdscript\n# Warning (INCOMPATIBLE_TERNARY): Values of the ternary operator are not mutually compatible.\n# Error: The variable type is being inferred from a Variant value, so it will be typed\n#        as Variant. (Warning treated as error.)\nvar a := Node2D.new() if x else Node3D.new()\nvar b := Resource.new() if x else Node.new()\n```\n\nThe error is related to the fact that when checking for type compatibility, metatypes are converted to the same value:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/788beb36dc54ee4307a32d52e4895017d3620375/modules/gdscript/gdscript_analyzer.cpp#L5172-L5185\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/788beb36dc54ee4307a32d52e4895017d3620375/modules/gdscript/gdscript_analyzer.cpp#L6225-L6227\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/788beb36dc54ee4307a32d52e4895017d3620375/modules/gdscript/gdscript_analyzer.cpp#L6269-L6271\n\nIn the current implementation of GDScript, such bugs are common and difficult to detect. We should try to fix them, but for now I'd recommend avoiding interaction with metatypes. In the long term, we should introduce a more robust type checking system.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738567747/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]